# UX workflow: author a Project-owned Recorded Shape from an empty registry.
# Purpose: proves direct flat creation, explicit hold-to-record, live capture,
# one atomic commit, empty-take discard, cancellation, and exact beat length.
# Expect: capture_changed:empty_registry=recorded_shape_picker, capture_changed:recorded_shape_picker=shape_ready, capture_changed:shape_ready=shape_armed
# Expect: capture_changed:shape_armed=shape_recording, capture_changed:shape_recording=shape_committed, capture_changed:shape_committed=empty_take_discarded
# Expect: capture_changed:empty_take_discarded=shape_cancelled, capture_changed:shape_cancelled=shape_length_6_beats
# Expect: semantic:shape_ready:effect=create_project_recorded_shape, semantic:shape_ready:outcome=applied, semantic:shape_ready:source=recorded_shape
# Expect: semantic:shape_armed:effect=arm_project_recorded_shape, semantic:shape_armed:operation_status=armed
# Expect: semantic:shape_recording:effect=record_project_recorded_shape_value, semantic:shape_recording:operation_status=recording
# Expect: semantic:shape_committed:effect=commit_project_recorded_shape, semantic:shape_committed:outcome=applied, semantic:shape_committed:operation_status=committed
# Expect: semantic:empty_take_discarded:effect=discard_empty_project_recorded_shape, semantic:empty_take_discarded:outcome=no_change
# Expect: semantic:shape_cancelled:effect=cancel_project_recorded_shape, semantic:shape_cancelled:outcome=cancelled
# Expect: semantic:shape_length_6_beats:property=length, semantic:shape_length_6_beats:value_label=6.0b

0 scenario project-modulator-destination

# Enter the empty first-rank Modulators view from Project Settings.
100 button LEFT_TOP down
700 encoder NAV -1
1100 button LEFT_TOP up
1320 capture screen empty_registry

# Add Source > Recorded Shape creates one durable, unassigned source and opens
# its complete editor directly on Record.
1440 tap NAV 60
1660 encoder NAV 1
1740 encoder NAV 1
1880 capture screen recorded_shape_picker
2000 tap NAV 60
2240 capture screen shape_ready

# Holding the learned bottom-left action only arms. RAW OPT motion writes and
# auditions the signed movement until the modifier is released.
2360 button BOTTOM_LEFT down
2620 capture screen shape_armed
2740 encoder OPT 64.00
3040 tick
3260 capture screen shape_recording
3380 button BOTTOM_LEFT up
3660 capture screen shape_committed

# A take without motion is explicitly discarded and consumes no history entry.
3780 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
4060 capture screen empty_take_discarded

# Back while the modifier remains held cancels the provisional curve only and
# keeps the same source editor/focus. The physical release is then inert.
4180 button BOTTOM_LEFT down
4400 encoder OPT -48.00
4620 tap LEFT_TOP 60
4900 capture screen shape_cancelled
5020 button BOTTOM_LEFT up

# Length remains the next direct card; six beats time-stretches the same
# Project source through one history action.
5240 encoder NAV 1
5360 encoder OPT 0.111111
5640 capture screen shape_length_6_beats
